* Police in Lusaka shot and wounded 26-year-old suspected ex-convict Patrick Moyo, who allegedly charged at them with a machete during an operation targeting break-ins in Kalikiliki and Mtendere East; seven other suspects were apprehended.

**Politics:**
* The National Reconciliation Party for Unity and Prosperity (NRPUP) has withdrawn from the Tonse Alliance effective immediately, citing a review of the alliance’s objectives and a need for an alternative path to serve its supporters.

